  "system": {
    "identifier": "senju-wood-release-wood-clone",
    "description": "<p>You conjure clones made of wood, the original inspiration of the Shadow Clone Technique.</p>\n<p>You can conjure up to 6 Wood Clones at once. The first clone costing 10 chakra, and each clone after the first costing 8 chakra per clone. Wood Clones have the following special characteristics;</p>\n<p>Wood Clones have 10 Hit points, 10 Temporary hit points and 10 DR against the first instance of damage they take per turn.</p>\n<p>They act at once and all attempt to perform the same command given.</p>\n<p>They can only provide the benefit of the help action to their summoner.</p>\n<p>Wood Clones can make up to 2 attacks when you command it to make a Clone Strike.</p>\n<p>Wood Clones add your Ninjutsu ability modifier in earth damage to the damage they deal.</p>\n<p>Wood Clones can cast Senju Hijutsu you know of C-Rank.</p>",
